This repository provides the TransNormal-2 inference pipeline, Local Continuity
Module (LCM), and Geometric Refinement Module (GRM). It uses the public Diffusers,
Transformers, PEFT, Accelerate, PyTorch, and Hugging Face Hub libraries, which
retain their own licenses. The full-RGB guided filter follows He et al.,
Guided Image Filtering (ECCV 2010).

The model weights are a modified derivative of FLUX.2 [klein] base 9B,
developed by Black Forest Labs Inc. TransNormal-2 adds task-specific LoRA
adapters, LCM, and GRM. Neither the base model nor task weights are bundled
with this code. Model weights and their terms are available at:
https://huggingface.co/Longxiang-ai/TransNormal-2

